    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "24. Core Abilities",
    "ruleNumber": "24.31",
    "summary": "Scouts X: in the Pre-battle Abilities step, a unit whose models all have this ability can do one of two things. A unit in Strategic Reserves may be placed anywhere wholly inside your deployment zone; a unit already wholly inside your deployment zone may instead make a Scout move. A Dedicated Transport wholly inside your deployment zone whose embarked models all have this ability is also allowed a Scout move.",
